      "sections": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "注水调配业务问题",
          "html": "<p>配注方案按季度人工调整，依据是近期吸水剖面与含水变化，反馈周期长；层间矛盾复杂时靠经验试调。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 335\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"分层配注量\"><title>分层配注量</title><rect width=\"720\" height=\"335\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f6f9f8\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#334741\"><path d=\"M124 265H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"end\">-12.8</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><path d=\"M124 211.25H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"216.25\" text-anchor=\"end\">33.6</text><text x=\"259.25\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1.5</text><path d=\"M124 157.5H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"162.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">80</text><text x=\"394.5\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><path d=\"M124 103.75H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"108.75\" text-anchor=\"end\">126.4</text><text x=\"529.75\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2.5</text><path d=\"M124 50H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"end\">172.8</text><text x=\"665\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><polyline fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#267d70\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" points=\"124,145.9159482758621 394.5,140.12392241379314 665,116.95581896551727\"/><circle cx=\"124\" cy=\"145.9159482758621\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"394.5\" cy=\"140.12392241379314\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"665\" cy=\"116.95581896551727\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><polyline fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b5692b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" points=\"124,134.33189655172416 394.5,134.33189655172416 665,134.33189655172416\"/><circle cx=\"124\" cy=\"134.33189655172416\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"394.5\" cy=\"134.33189655172416\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"665\" cy=\"134.33189655172416\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><polyline fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7659a8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" points=\"124,111.16379310344828 394.5,64.82758620689657 665,87.99568965517244\"/><circle cx=\"124\" cy=\"111.16379310344828\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#7659a8\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"394.5\" cy=\"64.82758620689657\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#7659a8\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"665\" cy=\"87.99568965517244\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#7659a8\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><text class=\"plot-x-label\" x=\"394.5\" y=\"324\" text-anchor=\"middle\">层号</text><text class=\"plot-y-label\" x=\"24\" y=\"157.5\" transform=\"rotate(-90 24 157.5)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">注水 / m³/d</text></g></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 1</b><span>分层配注与上限比较标出受限层；凹响应曲线显示继续增注的边际价值逐渐降低，因此最优不等于平均分配。图中是初始参数的固定种子教学计算，交互演示可重新计算。</span></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "INTERVENTION",
          "title": "分层响应与配注优化",
          "html": "<p>同一口注水井的层段吸水能力、含水水平和产油响应不同，平均分配水量可能挤占低含水层的有效额度。本例在AI辅助调配流程中采用边际收益计算，每次比较各层增加5立方米日配注后的目标增量，将水量分给仍有容量且增益最大的层段。计算同时遵守总量预算和层段上限，形成逐层可解释的调配结果。</p><p>优化 · 等配 · 吸水上限；横轴：层号；纵轴：注水 / m³/d。</p><p>系统一次输出各层推荐配注、吸水上限、目标贡献及未分配水量，注水人员可直接核对水量去向和限制因素。与等配方案并列后，能看清预算被重新分配到哪些层，哪些层因容量或边际收益停止增注。交付重点是减少手工轮流试配和汇总的环节，等配对照也列出层上限，便于识别其超限位置。</p><p><b>默认教学计算将三层配注从100/100/100调整为90/95/115 m³/d，两方案总量均为300 m³/d且满足各层上限。稳油代理由72.29升至72.96，增幅0.93%。</b></p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "层段记录与响应参数",
          "html": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:14px\">试点选择3—5个资料较完整的层段，整理同期分层注水量、吸水能力上限、对应含水及产油响应记录，由注水工程师确认层段对应关系和稳定生产窗口。这类任务的关键是响应参数与约束表，历史观测可用于估计增注后的变化。本例采用三层显式响应函数，展示含水和吸水上限变化对配注的影响。</p><div class=\"checklist\"><div class=\"cl-head\"><span>数据准备清单 · 5 项</span><span class=\"cl-prog\"><span id=\"cl-txt\">0 / 5</span><span class=\"cl-bar\"><i id=\"cl-fill\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"0\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">注水井分层数据</span><span class=\"cl-s\">层段、配注量、吸水剖面</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">按季度</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"1\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">油井生产响应</span><span class=\"cl-s\">产量、含水</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">日度</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"2\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">地质模型</span><span class=\"cl-s\">层间连通关系</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">约束条件</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"3\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">人工复核记录</span><span class=\"cl-s\">保留复核对象、原始证据与修订结论</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">分层注水、含水、吸水上限及响应记录</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"4\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">样本版本与评价明细</span><span class=\"cl-s\">按原始对象分组，保留评价记录与版本</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">用于复查数值和追踪更新</span></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">专业资料与数据依据</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><a class=\"ref\" href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/case-study-with-navigation/di/enhancing-waterflooding-efficiency-through-integrated-workflows-and-advanced-analytics\">SLB：注水监控与分析<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "DIFFICULTY",
          "title": "响应耦合与参数维护",
          "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:2px\"><span class=\"dtag\" data-d=\"中\">难度 中</span><span class=\"small muted\">层间响应与注采滞后使边际收益估计困难</span></div><div class=\"meter\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"\"></i></div><p>主要障碍是层间连通、注采滞后和压力变化会使同一增注量产生不同响应，含水变化也会影响对收益的判断。工程师需要维护稳定窗口内的响应关系，核查异常吸水层和突变时段。本例的无交叉耦合凹响应为AI调配提供可解释优化基线；补充现场资料时，应优先辨认层间串流及延迟，更新响应参数和容量约束。</p><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">可借鉴的通用技术</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/opt\">约束优化<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/opt\">注采连通分析<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/opt\">代理模型<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
